    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Essence Hunters is a roguelike survival, loot and item creation game. Explore, fight, create weapons, evolve your character and fight again. You can build your character according to what suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/f853518697cc3a4521a98938cf9be772.avif?t=1755476742\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and exploration:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best path on the board to reach the objective, while facing creatures and collecting materials.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the creatures and paths that provide you with the exact materials to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b281af1899f5cdbda5106dc655f7ed20.poster.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b281af1899f5cdbda5106dc655f7ed20.webm?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b281af1899f5cdbda5106dc655f7ed20.mp4?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card System:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board contains cards that can provide a random reward, such as fortifications for future battles or resources for the hunter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/0f83933c000e7f836514fdf37e40e55e.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item creation:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the materials found to create equipment that will help in the next battles, build the build that best suits the situation or the chosen character.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items vary in their effects, find out which one suits your hunter and their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find item creation recipes around the board, thus increasing your weapon creation arsenal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b1eabf6169d7c5e2d58c4b4bfdb5bff5.poster.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b1eabf6169d7c5e2d58c4b4bfdb5bff5.webm?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b1eabf6169d7c5e2d58c4b4bfdb5bff5.mp4?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your class:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character begins the journey with blocked skills, defeating creatures and gaining experience you unlock skills, you can assemble a hunter with different skills. Build it your way and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/4d5433dc9faf653e9734f2d700b1c948.poster.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/4d5433dc9faf653e9734f2d700b1c948.webm?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/4d5433dc9faf653e9734f2d700b1c948.mp4?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Essence Hunters is a roguelike survival, loot and item creation game. Explore, fight, create weapons, evolve your character and fight again. You can build your character according to what suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/f853518697cc3a4521a98938cf9be772.avif?t=1755476742\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and exploration:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best path on the board to reach the objective, while facing creatures and collecting materials.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the creatures and paths that provide you with the exact materials to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b281af1899f5cdbda5106dc655f7ed20.poster.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b281af1899f5cdbda5106dc655f7ed20.webm?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b281af1899f5cdbda5106dc655f7ed20.mp4?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card System:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board contains cards that can provide a random reward, such as fortifications for future battles or resources for the hunter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/0f83933c000e7f836514fdf37e40e55e.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item creation:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the materials found to create equipment that will help in the next battles, build the build that best suits the situation or the chosen character.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items vary in their effects, find out which one suits your hunter and their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find item creation recipes around the board, thus increasing your weapon creation arsenal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b1eabf6169d7c5e2d58c4b4bfdb5bff5.poster.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b1eabf6169d7c5e2d58c4b4bfdb5bff5.webm?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/b1eabf6169d7c5e2d58c4b4bfdb5bff5.mp4?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your class:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character begins the journey with blocked skills, defeating creatures and gaining experience you unlock skills, you can assemble a hunter with different skills. Build it your way and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/4d5433dc9faf653e9734f2d700b1c948.poster.avif?t=1755476742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/4d5433dc9faf653e9734f2d700b1c948.webm?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429410/extras/4d5433dc9faf653e9734f2d700b1c948.mp4?t=1755476742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
